  {
   "bbox": [
    78.9,
    122.6,
    533.1,
    136.1
   ],
   "text": "WAYMON BOYD (O.N. 261512) EXPLOSION, FIRE, AND LOSS OF LIFE ON TULE",
   "conf": 0.9873,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    123.5,
    136.1,
    487.3,
    150.1
   ],
   "text": "LAKE CHANNEL IN CORPUS CHRISTI, TX ON AUGUST 21, 2020",
   "conf": 0.9984,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    235.9,
    179.2,
    374.5,
    189.6
   ],
   "text": "EXECUTIVE SUMMARY",
   "conf": 0.9779,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    71.3,
    220.0,
    523.9,
    233.1
   ],
   "text": "On the morning of August 21, 2020, the U.S. flagged non-self-propelled cutter suction dredge",
   "conf": 0.9898,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    71.3,
    233.1,
    529.5,
    246.3
   ],
   "text": "WAYMON BOYD (O.N. 261512) was conducting Phase 2 of the EPIC Marine Terminal berth",
   "conf": 0.9948,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    70.9,
    247.5,
    496.9,
    260.7
   ],
   "text": "dredging project on Tule Lake Channel in Corpus Christi, Texas. It was a clear day with",
   "conf": 0.9969,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    71.3,
    261.9,
    243.4,
    273.8
   ],
   "text": "unlimited visibility and calm water.",
   "conf": 0.9909,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    70.5,
    287.4,
    525.1,
    303.4
   ],
   "text": "WAYMON BOYD dredging operations were frequently interrupted by rocks and debris. That",
   "conf": 0.9999,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    70.5,
    303.0,
    516.0,
    316.2
   ],
   "text": "morning, the Day Leverman had expressed concerns to the Dredge Captain of hitting debris,",
   "conf": 0.9993,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    70.5,
    316.6,
    515.2,
    329.7
   ],
   "text": "leading the cutterhead to be repositioned toward the shoreline, five feet from the edge of the",
   "conf": 0.9988,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    70.1,
    329.3,
    532.3,
    344.1
   ],
   "text": "dredge template. At 0802, the WAYMON BOYD cutterhead struck submerged TX219 propane",
   "conf": 0.995,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    70.5,
    344.1,
    509.2,
    357.3
   ],
   "text": "pipeline during the first cut of the bank. Subsequently, the submerged pipeline released an",
   "conf": 0.9945,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    70.9,
    358.1,
    513.2,
    371.2
   ],
   "text": "odorless and colorless propane gas unbeknownst to the crewmembers onboard, propelling a",
   "conf": 0.9996,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    69.7,
    370.5,
    516.4,
    386.4
   ],
   "text": "water geyser and encompassing the WAYMON BOYD. The propane gas entered the engine",
   "conf": 0.9948,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    70.1,
    385.2,
    514.8,
    399.2
   ],
   "text": "room through ventilation fans and met an unknown engine room ignition source, causing an",
   "conf": 0.9963,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    70.9,
    399.6,
    393.3,
    412.8
   ],
   "text": "explosion and fire engulfing the dredge 66 seconds after the strike.",
   "conf": 0.9944,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    71.3,
    426.7,
    510.8,
    439.9
   ],
   "text": "This explosion and fire caused the loss of five crewmembers lives and injuries to five more",
   "conf": 0.994,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    71.3,
    441.9,
    142.6,
    452.7
   ],
   "text": "crewmembers.",
   "conf": 1.0,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    70.9,
    468.3,
    524.7,
    481.4
   ],
   "text": "As a result of its investigation, the Coast Guard determined the initiating event occurred when",
   "conf": 0.9976,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    70.5,
    481.4,
    523.9,
    495.4
   ],
   "text": "the cutterhead of WAYMON BOYD struck TX219 pipeline, releasing propane into the water.",
   "conf": 0.9953,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    70.5,
    495.0,
    537.9,
    509.8
   ],
   "text": "The subsequent events were an explosion and fire resulting in loss of life. The causal factors that",
   "conf": 0.989,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    70.1,
    509.0,
    536.7,
    523.7
   ],
   "text": "contributed to these events were: (1) Non-existent or inadequate planning protocols for dredging",
   "conf": 0.9998,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    70.5,
    523.7,
    518.8,
    536.9
   ],
   "text": "near pipelines, (2) Failure of Orion to incorporate pipeline into dredging software, (3) Latent",
   "conf": 0.9896,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    70.5,
    536.9,
    525.5,
    550.5
   ],
   "text": "unsafe condition of Orion's Safety Program, (4) Inadequate training of crewmembers working",
   "conf": 0.991,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    70.5,
    551.3,
    523.1,
    564.5
   ],
   "text": "near pipelines, (5) Lack of professional training requirements for mariners working on dredge",
   "conf": 0.9989,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    70.5,
    564.5,
    493.7,
    578.0
   ],
   "text": "vessels, (6) Failure of Orion to teach crewmembers when to de-energize machinery and",
   "conf": 0.9921,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    70.1,
    578.0,
    503.6,
    592.8
   ],
   "text": "operational equipment, (7) Failure of Orion to train crewmembers properly on emergency",
   "conf": 0.997,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    70.5,
    592.8,
    489.7,
    606.0
   ],
   "text": "response to striking a pipeline, and (8) Lack of Coast Guard regulations covering basic",
   "conf": 0.9991,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    70.1,
    606.0,
    253.8,
    619.5
   ],
   "text": "requirements onboard dredge vessels.",
   "conf": 0.9963,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
